  "claim_ceiling": "Original Supplementary Table 2 is a strain catalogue: exactly four source-labelled evolved Dry representative genotypes across WspA, WspC and WspE; one evolved Mucoid revertant; 19 constructed isolates and two source ancestor/prior strains. The 20 selected sequenced D morphotypes referenced in Methods do not appear individually with their alleles in this table. Therefore 2/4 at wspA cannot be interpreted as the mutation-target frequency among the 20 selected fans, nor can 20/20 estimate the incidence of division of labour from all founding M colonies. Constructed isolates do not count as independent natural evolution. This table does not identify BITA K(u), trait-axis split in a two-function generalist, or historical hysteresis.",
